OL,4,CCanada's top court largely upholds     
OL,5,CQuebec ban on religious symbols for    
OL,6,Cpublic servants                        
OL,7,GCanada's top court has largely upheld  
OL,8,Ga Quebec law banning public sector     
OL,9,Gworkers from wearing religious         
OL,10,Gsymbols, including the hijab and the   
OL,11,Gcross.                                 
OL,13,FThe law, known as Bill 21, faced legal 
OL,14,Fchallenges from a range of groups,     
OL,15,Fincluding female Muslim, Sikh and      
OL,16,FCatholic teachers, who argued it       
OL,17,Fviolated their fundamental rights.     
